# ugc-reel defaults. No secrets in this file; it ships with the skill and is safe to share.
# Per-user overrides live in ~/.config/ugc-reel/config.env (written by the skill at onboarding) and win over this file.

# Where the brand profile, templates, packshots and campaigns live. Set at onboarding.
# UGC_LIBRARY="$HOME/UGC Library"

# Staging files for Enhancor (anchor stills, local packshots). Enhancor only takes URLs.
#   none  : nothing to configure. Packshots must already have public URLs; beat repairs that need an uploaded still are off.
#   s3    : your own S3-compatible bucket via the AWS CLI (AWS S3, Cloudflare R2, Backblaze B2, MinIO...). Needs UGC_S3_BUCKET;
#           optional AWS_PROFILE, AWS_REGION, AWS_ENDPOINT_URL (for non-AWS providers). Uploads land under UGC_S3_PREFIX/ only.
#   cmd   : any command that takes a local file path as its one argument and prints one public URL on stdout.
UGC_UPLOAD=none
UGC_S3_BUCKET=
UGC_S3_PREFIX=ugc-inputs
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
# AWS_PROFILE=
# AWS_ENDPOINT_URL=
# UGC_UPLOAD_CMD=

# Local transcription (whisper.cpp). The doctor downloads this model on request.
UGC_WHISPER_MODEL="$HOME/.config/ugc-reel/models/ggml-base.bin"
UGC_WHISPER_LANG=auto
